  "extractionNotes": "Self-employed on the preferential base (0570). First period 2025-12-01..2026-06-30 with voluntary sickness insurance, deregistered (confirmed with the account); the same title again from 2026-07-28 with sickness from 2026-07-28, the date of her correction filing. No cover 2026-07-01..2026-07-27, which includes the birth on 2026-07-09 (taken as the maternity start). She wrote that she had resumed the business on 2026-07-01; the retroactive start was not accepted. ZUS cover note: maternity benefit refused for 2026-07-09..2026-11-26 (as claimed; 141 days, one more than 20 weeks). Decision text not in the file, so no legal basis is recorded. A second ZAM for parental leave is not decided in the file and is not modelled. endReason businessSuspended is inferred from her statement."
